		{
			"statement": "Dans l'espace, $\\vec{u}$, $\\vec{v}$ et $\\vec{w}$ sont trois vecteurs tels que $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}={{p}}$ et $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{w}={{q}}$.\n\nCalcule $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\left({{if:a==1|\\vec{v}}}{{if:a==-1|-\\vec{v}}}{{if:a!=1 && a!=-1|{{eval:a}}\\vec{v}}}{{if:b==1|+\\vec{w}}}{{if:b==-1|-\\vec{w}}}{{if:b>1|+{{eval:b}}\\vec{w}}}{{if:b< -1|{{eval:b}}\\vec{w}}}\\right)$.\n\n$\\vec{u}\\cdot\\left({{if:a==1|\\vec{v}}}{{if:a==-1|-\\vec{v}}}{{if:a!=1 && a!=-1|{{eval:a}}\\vec{v}}}{{if:b==1|+\\vec{w}}}{{if:b==-1|-\\vec{w}}}{{if:b>1|+{{eval:b}}\\vec{w}}}{{if:b< -1|{{eval:b}}\\vec{w}}}\\right)=?$",
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:a*p+b*q}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Le produit scalaire est **bilinéaire** : $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\left(a\\vec{v}+b\\vec{w}\\right)=a\\,(\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v})+b\\,(\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{w})$.",
					"$\\vec{u}\\cdot\\left({{if:a==1|\\vec{v}}}{{if:a==-1|-\\vec{v}}}{{if:a!=1 && a!=-1|{{eval:a}}\\vec{v}}}{{if:b==1|+\\vec{w}}}{{if:b==-1|-\\vec{w}}}{{if:b>1|+{{eval:b}}\\vec{w}}}{{if:b< -1|{{eval:b}}\\vec{w}}}\\right)={{a}}\\times{{eval:p;()}}+{{eval:b;()}}\\times{{eval:q;()}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{eval:a*p+b*q}} }$"
